{"id":"609626","name":"蟹黄白菜手擀面","author":"筠旸JY","authorId":"7345450","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/609626/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"蟹黄","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"手擀面","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱姜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"母河蟹好肥。","img":"images/609626/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把蟹黄剥离出来，我准备了一小碗。","img":"images/609626/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"我选用的是白菜叶，洗净切成小块儿。","img":"images/609626/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"手擀面备好（之前发过做法）。","img":"images/609626/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅内放少许油烧热然后放入葱姜末爆香。","img":"images/609626/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入白菜叶翻炒均匀至软。","img":"images/609626/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入蟹黄继续翻炒几下。","img":"images/609626/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入适量清水烧开。","img":"images/609626/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加少许盐调味。","img":"images/609626/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入手擀面。","img":"images/609626/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煮熟。","img":"images/609626/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅前放入少许鸡精调味即可关火。","img":"images/609626/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"倒入碗里。","img":"images/609626/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/609626/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/609626/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}